<title>USA: Ginnie Mae sets $200 mln REMIC 1997-002.</title>
<headline>Ginnie Mae sets $200 mln REMIC 1997-002.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government National Mortgage Association (Ginnie Mae or GNMA) said it issued about $200 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC 1997-002, sponsored by Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and co-sponsored by Untendahl Capital Partners LP, is backed by 7.5 percent GNMA II certificates, Ginnie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue priced January 6 and has a settlement of February 28, it said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
